{"title":"Body","body":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"version":{"type":"string","example":"v16","description":"PostgreSQL version (supported: v15, v16, v17, v18)"},"replicas":{"type":"integer","format":"int64","description":"Number of replicas.\n1 = standalone mode (storage-level replication)\n2-8 = cluster mode (application-level replication)\nMode cannot be changed after creation.","maximum":8,"minimum":1},"external":{"type":"boolean","description":"Enable external access via LoadBalancer"},"size":{"type":"integer","format":"int64","description":"Storage capacity in GB","maximum":4096,"minimum":1},"preset":{"type":"string","description":"Resources preset for the cluster"},"config":{"type":"object","properties":{"maxConnections":{"type":"integer","format":"int64","description":"Maximum number of concurrent connections","maximum":10000,"minimum":1}}},"quorum":{"type":"object","properties":{"maxSyncReplicas":{"type":"integer","format":"int64","description":"Maximum number of synchronous replicas (must be >= min_sync_replicas)","maximum":10},"minSyncReplicas":{"type":"integer","format":"int64","description":"Minimum number of synchronous replicas","maximum":10}}}}}}},"required":true}}